{{!-- The twelve rows of the Scars table, drawn from the `Scars` RollTable in the `tables` pack, by
      title alone: the chosen row's prose is already in the head. Shown to the Warden on request
      and from the start when there was no hit; `hidden` otherwise, because a part keeps its root.

      Chosen is said with ink, never with a hue: the row's number is filled the way a marked slot
      is. The list is the scroller, which is what the part's `scrollable` is for. --}}
<ol class="cairn-plain-list cairn-scars-list" {{#unless showTable}}hidden{{/unless}}>
    {{#each rows as |row|}}
    <li class="cairn-scars-row{{#if row.selected}} selected{{/if}}" {{#unless @root.locked}}data-action="scarPick"{{/unless}} data-entry="{{row.entry}}"
        {{#unless @last}}data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="scar-row-{{row.entry}}" data-ink-w="0.9" data-ink-a="0.42" data-ink-at="bottom"{{/unless}}>
        <span class="cairn-scars-n">{{row.entry}}</span>
        <span class="cairn-scars-text">{{row.title}}</span>
    </li>
    {{/each}}
</ol>
